<style>
    @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
    .page {
        width: 794px; height: 1123px;
        padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
        overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
        position: relative;
        font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Defaulting to serif for formal look */
    }
    .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
    h1 { font-size: 36pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    h2 { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    p { font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 11pt; }
    .form-row > div { width: 48%; }
    .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 60px; margin-bottom: 5px; width: 50%; }
    .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 12pt; }
</style>

<div class="page">
    <h1>HOWARD</h1>
    <h2>UNIVERSITY</h2>
    <p>Direct Deposit Form</p>

    <p>Completing this form authorizes the trustee of {{ organization_name }} to deposit your monthly pension payments to a financial institution you specify and to instruct your financial institution to appropriately credit/debit your account in the case of a deposit error. Your monthly pension will be electronically deposited into your specified account within two months after this completed form is received.</p>

    <p>Do not complete this form if you intend to have your payment directly deposited to a foreign financial institution. Due to Automated Clearing House (ACH) requirements, we cannot accept direct deposit instructions that will forward the pension payments across the U.S. border to a foreign financial institution.</p>

    <p>To elect direct deposit, all information must be completed and returned to Office of Human Resources at {{ address_line_1 }} {{ address_line_2 }} {{ zip_code }} or via email to <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>. Obtain the ABA routing number from your financial institution.</p>

    <div class="section-title">Financial Institution Name:</div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div>Account Number: _________________________</div>
        <div>Type of Account: <input type="checkbox"> Checking <input type="checkbox"> Savings</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div>Financial Institution ABA Routing No. (Must always be 9 digits): _________________________</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">Your Signature</div>
    <p>I authorize the trustee of {{ organization_name }} to deposit my monthly pension payment as indicated above. I certify that the account indicated above is not a foreign financial institution.</p>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <div>Participant's Signature: <div class="signature-line" data-field="your_signature">{{ your_signature }}</div></div>
        <div>Date: <div class="signature-line" data-field="participant_s_signature">{{ participant_s_signature }}</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div>Name (please print): <div class="signature-line" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div></div>
        <div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div>Daytime Phone Number: _________________________</div>
        <div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">For More Information</div>
    <p>If you need additional information, call {{ phone_number }} or visit <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span>. {{ organization_name }} Human Resources Representatives are available between {{ time_range }}.</p>
</div>